INSUFFICIENT the response shows that Command.Help() (command.go:473, snippet: "func (c *Command) Help() error {
	c.HelpFunc()(c, []string{})
	return nil
}") only invokes HelpFunc and returns nil, and none of the other evidence (HelpFunc at command.go:452, InitDefaultHelpCmd at command.go:1229, the Command struct at command.go:51, the "--help" flag constant in command_test.go:2572, or the user_guide.md/active_help.md doc excerpts) shows any os.Exit call, early-return-from-Execute logic, or documented mechanism for causing the program to exit after --help runs, so there is no basis in this response for how to make --help exit.
